{
  "Package": "DelayedRandomArray",
  "Version": "1.18.0",
  "Date": "2024-07-05",
  "Title": "Delayed Arrays of Random Values",
  "Description": "Implements a DelayedArray of random values where the\nrealization of the sampled values is delayed until they are\nneeded. Reproducible sampling within any subarray is achieved\nby chunking where each chunk is initialized with a different\nrandom seed and stream. The usual distributions in the stats\npackage are supported, along with scalar, vector and arrays for\nthe parameters.",
